  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main business activity of Total Artefactos S.A. (TASA) is retail sales of household appliances and other items in Peru under the La Curacao trademark. The company has 1,760 employees and is one of the country&#x2019;s leading electrical appliance retailers, with 90 stores nationwide.The IIC financing of up to US$4.5 million will be used to expand TASA&#x2019;s chain of retail establishments in medium-sized cities outside of greater Lima.</narrative>
  </description>
